  <name>PeekCam</name>
  <summary>Movable always-on-top webcam overlay</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      PeekCam floats your webcam in a corner of the screen, always on top, so it stays
      visible over any window — ideal for screen recording and streaming.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Drag anywhere and resize; rectangle, rounded, or circle shapes</li>
      <li>Adjustable opacity, mirror, and click-through (mouse passes through)</li>
      <li>Every camera control the device exposes (brightness, exposure, focus, …)</li>
      <li>Source and resolution/frame-rate switching</li>
      <li>Snapshot and recording</li>
      <li>Optional background blur (keeps you sharp, blurs the background)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.sebszwolin777.PeekCam.desktop</launchable>

